+It triggers the relevant paths to quit and save all apps via both ksmserver and the session's compositor, abstracting the session differences between X11 and Wayland. If this is successful, then any shutdown scripts are run, and finally the compositor and ksmserver are terminated. After returning success or failure, the helper exits.
 
